---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Business Systems Services | Static Pulse Sites"
  description="Explore website development, AI systems and automation, and custom internal software for small and medium businesses."
>
  <main>
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <h1>Business systems built around the way your company works.</h1>

        <p class="lead hero-lead">
          Static Pulse Sites helps small and medium businesses improve their
          public-facing websites, automate repetitive processes, and build
          focused internal software when existing tools are not enough.
        </p>

        <div class="button-row">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">
            Start Your Project
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <h2>Three connected ways to improve your business.</h2>

          <p class="lead">
            Each service can stand alone or become part of a larger system.
            We recommend the simplest solution that addresses the problem.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-3">
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Website Development</h3>

            <p>
              Fast, secure websites that support your customer journey and
              connect with the tools behind your business.
            </p>

            <a
              class="text-link"
              href="/services/website-development"
              aria-label="Explore Website Development"
            >
              Explore Website Development →
            </a>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <h3>AI Systems &amp; Automation</h3>

            <p>
              Practical workflows that connect your existing platforms and
              reduce repetitive manual work.
            </p>

            <a
              class="text-link"
              href="/services/ai-systems-automation"
              aria-label="Explore AI Systems and Automation"
            >
              Explore AI Systems &amp; Automation →
            </a>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <h3>Custom Internal Software</h3>

            <p>
              Focused internal tools designed around the way your team manages
              clients, information, projects, and operations.
            </p>

            <a
              class="text-link"
              href="/services/custom-internal-software"
              aria-label="Explore Custom Internal Software"
            >
              Explore Custom Internal Software →
            </a>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="cta-box">
          <h2>Not sure which service fits the problem?</h2>

          <p class="lead">
            Tell us what is slowing your business down. You do not need to know
            which technology or service you need before contacting us.
          </p>

          <div class="button-row">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">
              Start Your Project
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>